+**Host:** rotate service → event → ongoing effects → choose tile → invite exact gentry → staff tile/cards → positive then negative favours → buy → expend/discard/upgrade.
+
+**Pass:** fully refresh service → recover gentry → event/ongoing effects → £200 or Market refresh → buy → expend any servant used.
+
+**Season:** three turns each → courtship → move Reserve tiles → refresh Market → reveal theme → pass first player anticlockwise.
+
+**Costs:** £100 for 2 reputation; Quarters servant to Available for 3 reputation; special Market refresh for 4 reputation (once). Buy one tile, except Builders’ Holiday/Market Purchase. Never acquire duplicates.
